# LightDock production-scale run output (92 MB, ~1900 regenerable files --
# raw pose/checkpoint data from a 400-swarm run; exact regeneration commands
# are documented in test_examples/protein_protein_1brs/DOCUMENTATION.md
# section 8.2. The small-scale lightdock_run/ comparison directory and the
# summary lightdock_production_sim.log are kept -- only the bulky raw
# per-swarm output is excluded, matching this file's existing policy on
# large regenerable trajectory/movie output above.)
test_examples/protein_protein_1brs/lightdock_run_production/
